<%# Sticky action drawer — peeks up from the bottom while the primary actions
    (#primary-actions) are scrolled out of view, so Save / Preview / (Un)publish
    + the save-state dot stay reachable in long content. Lives inside the editor
    controller so the buttons' actions and the saveDot/saveMessage targets
    resolve to it.

    translate-y-full = hidden by default; the editor-drawer controller adds the
    transition after the first paint so the on-load restore is instant (no slide
    flash on save/refresh).

    Locals: resource, resource_type. %>
<div data-controller="editor-drawer"
     data-editor-drawer-anchor-value="#primary-actions"
     class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 translate-y-full bg-white border-t border-gray-800 px-8 py-2 shadow-[0_-2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)]">
  <%= render "shared/editor_primary_actions", resource: resource, resource_type: resource_type %>
</div>
